  "solution": {
    "text": "The line is perpendicular to normal, hence the line is parallel to plane, so the reflected line has the same direction.<br />Now, image of <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2,1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> in the plane is <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>α</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>β</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>γ</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> say, then<br /><math><mfrac><mrow><mi>α</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>β</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>γ</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>7</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math><br />So, the point is <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>4,3</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;",
